user.description:
Enter your E-REDES Balcao Digital access token and CPE code.

To get your access token:
1. Log into {setup_url}
2. Open browser dev tools (F12)
3. Go to Application > Cookies > {setup_url}
4. Copy the value of the 'aat' cookie

reauth_confirm.description:
Your E-REDES access token has expired. Please enter a new one for CPE {cpe}.

To get your access token:
1. Log into {setup_url}
2. Open browser dev tools (F12)
3. Go to Application > Cookies > {setup_url}
4. Copy the value of the 'aat' cookie
